{"id":"krik","lemma":"крик","pos":"noun","rank":1780,"glosses":["cry (a shout or scream), outcry, scream, shout, shouting, yell"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"крика","plural":"крики"},"examples":[{"text":"Я слышал крик женщины.","en":"I heard a woman scream.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},null,{"g":"woman","l":"женщина"}]},{"text":"Мы слышали крики.","en":"We heard screams.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},null]},{"text":"Ты не слышал крик?","en":"Didn't you hear a scream?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},null]},{"text":"Это крик о помощи.","en":"It's a cry for help.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"about"},{"g":"help, assistance, aid","l":"помощь"}]},{"text":"Ваши крики напугали меня.","en":"Your screams frightened me.","words":[{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null,{"g":"to frighten","l":"напугать"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]}]}